OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a cloudy day with
OL,6,Flight rain and drizzle in the morning.
OL,7,FThrough the afternoon rain will
OL,8,Fgradually ease leaving dry conditions.
OL,9,FLight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be cloudy through the
OL,12,Fevening and overnight and staying
OL,13,Fmostly dry except for a few light
OL,14,Fshowers around the coasts. Mist and
OL,15,Ffog may form in the south.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FAny mist and fog clearing in
OL,18,Fthe morning to leave a largely dry day
OL,19,Fwith bright or sunny spells
OL,20,Fdeveloping. The odd shower around the
OL,21,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
